IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADD-TEST.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 2.
01 B      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 3.
01 TOTAL  PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "ADD-NUMBERS" USING A B TOTAL
    IF TOTAL NOT = 5
        DISPLAY "2 + 3 <> 5" UPON SYSERR
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "ok"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM ADD-TEST.
